│ name when using it as a default value for a CharField. This leads  │
│ to translation issues and errors after translation.                │
│                                                                    │
│ Here's a breakdown of the steps and the API calls I'll use:        │
│                                                                    │
│  1 Understand Migration Generation: We need to see how Django's    │
│    migration generation process handles enum defaults.             │
