│       need to adjust the line number based on the output of the    │
│       previous step.                                               │
│  3 Investigate Default Value Handling: Let's check how Django      │
│    handles default values in migrations.                           │
│     • search_method_in_class("get_fields",                         │
│       "django.db.models.fields.CharField"):  This will help us     │
